q_p11_amounts: (?"What is this person's tax base for the year (podstawa obliczenia podatku), the UK income included? Przykład 11 gives no amounts." (tax_base[monika, 2020]), ?"What UK tax was paid on the year's UK income, in złoty? Przykład 11 gives no amounts, nor which part of the UK tax year falls in the calendar year." (tax_uk[monika, 2020]) ?"What income did this person earn in the UK in the year, in złoty at the rates of art. 11a? Przykład 11 gives no amounts or exchange rates." (income_uk[monika, 2020]) ?"What income other than from the UK did this person have in the year? Przykład 11 gives no amounts for 2020." (income_other[monika, 2020]) ?"What is this person's tax base for the year (podstawa obliczenia podatku), the UK income included? Przykład 11 gives no amounts." (tax_base[monika, 2020]), ?"What UK tax was paid on the year's UK income, in złoty? Przykład 11 gives no amounts, nor which part of the UK tax year falls in the calendar year." (tax_uk[monika, 2020]) ?"What income did this person earn in the UK in the year, in złoty at the rates of art. 11a? Przykład 11 gives no amounts or exchange rates." (income_uk[monika, 2020]) ?"What income other than from the UK did this person have in the year? Przykład 11 gives no amounts for 2020." (income_other[monika, 2020]) ?"What is this person's tax base for the year (podstawa obliczenia podatku), the UK income included? Przykład 11 gives no amounts." (tax_base[monika, 2020]))
